You are free to share and adapt the data for any purpose, provided you give
appropriate credit: "Estanislao Porta, vegan-protein-economics dataset".

Data source: prices and nutritional values were collected manually from
Finnish supermarket product pages (primarily s-kaupat.fi) and product labels.
Prices are approximate and reflect shelf prices at the time of collection;
they may vary by store, date, and promotion.
